1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,508
Outlook sempat mati sekitar sehari.

2
00:00:02,508 --> 00:00:05,017
Dan itu bukan karena diretas.

3
00:00:05,417 --> 00:00:06,858
Tanggal 12 November,

4
00:00:06,858 --> 00:00:09,259
server email Microsoft mulai gagal

5
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:11,180
di pemeriksaan otomatisnya sendiri,

6
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,141
lalu offline.

7
00:00:12,141 --> 00:00:15,503
Server yang tersisa kewalahan dan ikut tumbang.

8
00:00:15,503 --> 00:00:18,865
Outlook dan Teams lumpuh di seluruh dunia.

9
00:00:18,865 --> 00:00:21,267
Penyebab pastinya belum diumumkan Microsoft.

10
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:23,656
Kalau terjadi lagi,

11
00:00:23,656 --> 00:00:26,972
cek dulu halaman status Microsoft.

12
00:00:26,972 --> 00:00:29,625
Siap-siap email telat masuk.

13
00:00:29,625 --> 00:00:30,951
Yang mendesak,

14
00:00:30,951 --> 00:00:34,267
pindahkan ke telepon atau WhatsApp.

15
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:37,067
Perlu pindah ke Google?

16
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:37,667
Bisa,

17
00:00:37,667 --> 00:00:40,667
tapi Google juga pernah down,

18
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:44,267
dan migrasi satu kantor itu mahal.

19
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:47,267
Rencana cadangan jauh lebih murah.

20
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:50,431
Kita nggak bisa mencegah Microsoft gangguan,

21
00:00:50,431 --> 00:00:53,195
tapi bisa menjaga bisnis tetap jalan.

22
00:00:53,195 --> 00:00:55,037
Tentukan jalur komunikasi kedua,

23
00:00:55,037 --> 00:00:57,341
simpan kontak penting secara offline,

24
00:00:57,341 --> 00:00:59,183
dan latih rencananya sekali.

25
00:00:59,583 --> 00:01:02,928
Kantor kamu ngapain waktu Outlook mati?

26
00:01:02,928 --> 00:01:04,600
Tulis di komentar.
